WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.236 --> 00:00:02.271
you are live in the CNN

00:00:02.538 --> 00:00:03.405
newsroom, I'm Jim Acosta in

00:00:03.672 --> 00:00:03.872
Washington.

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:05.407
Good evening, it is now

00:00:05.674 --> 00:00:06.408
midnight in Morocco.

00:00:06.675 --> 00:00:08.410
More than 24 hours after a

00:00:08.677 --> 00:00:10.479
powerful 6.8 magnitude

00:00:10.746 --> 00:00:12.815
earthquake rocked the country,

00:00:13.249 --> 00:00:14.250
killing more than 2000 people.

00:00:15.751 --> 00:00:16.885
1400 people are said to be in

00:00:17.253 --> 00:00:18.254
critical condition at this

00:00:18.287 --> 00:00:18.420
hour.

00:00:18.754 --> 00:00:19.822
Here we see a rescue team,

00:00:20.256 --> 00:00:21.757
pulling a woman out of the

00:00:22.258 --> 00:00:22.424
rubble.

00:00:22.424 --> 00:00:23.759
And, as searches continue, the

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:24.827
death toll, we are told by

00:00:25.261 --> 00:00:27.763
officials, is expected to climb

00:00:28.264 --> 00:00:30.899
even higher, as than --

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:32.968
continues to grind on their

00:00:33.269 --> 00:00:33.369
market.

00:00:33.636 --> 00:00:34.837
CNN's Sam kiley joins us from

00:00:35.271 --> 00:00:35.304
marrakech.

00:00:35.771 --> 00:00:37.273
Sam, what's the latest there?

00:00:37.773 --> 00:00:38.907
You are back I think in that

00:00:39.275 --> 00:00:41.910
location, where you saw perhaps

00:00:42.278 --> 00:00:43.279
the ceiling above you giving

00:00:43.379 --> 00:00:44.880
way, just a touch, how are

00:00:45.281 --> 00:00:48.284
things looking where you are at?

00:00:48.284 --> 00:00:50.886
&gt;&gt; Well Jim, you put your

00:00:51.287 --> 00:00:52.821
finger on what everybody here

00:00:53.289 --> 00:00:53.956
is most of afraid of.

00:00:54.757 --> 00:00:56.759
Here in the Medina, and the old

00:00:57.293 --> 00:00:59.295
city of America, an environment

00:00:59.295 --> 00:01:00.763
that really, certainly not in

00:01:01.297 --> 00:01:01.497
living memory, and certainly

00:01:01.764 --> 00:01:02.765
for many, people not even in

00:01:03.299 --> 00:01:04.700
the history books, has any

00:01:05.301 --> 00:01:06.302
recollection of being worried

00:01:06.302 --> 00:01:07.303
about an earthquake.

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:09.905
Here you have the direct result

00:01:10.306 --> 00:01:10.773
of it.

00:01:10.773 --> 00:01:13.842
The collapse of a --

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:15.778
that space there is the night

00:01:16.312 --> 00:01:17.313
sky above it, so you've got a

00:01:17.313 --> 00:01:20.316
roof, the floor, to ceilings,

00:01:20.316 --> 00:01:21.917
all collapsed down onto the

00:01:22.318 --> 00:01:22.985
ground here, where I am

00:01:23.319 --> 00:01:23.385
standing.

00:01:23.719 --> 00:01:24.920
And then if you look at these

00:01:25.321 --> 00:01:26.855
buildings, wherese very

00:01:27.323 --> 00:01:28.857
narrow streets, these very very

00:01:29.325 --> 00:01:31.860
narrow streets gem. And all of these buildings have

00:01:32.328 --> 00:01:34.730
got enormous cracks down the

00:01:34.997 --> 00:01:37.333
side, and the concern obviously

00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:39.868
is if any of these cracks give

00:01:40.336 --> 00:01:42.738
way as a result of future

00:01:43.339 --> 00:01:43.939
tremors, then the death toll

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:46.742
here in marrakech, which is at

00:01:47.009 --> 00:01:48.944
least 13, possibly higher, is

00:01:49.345 --> 00:01:49.945
certain to go up.

00:01:50.346 --> 00:01:51.880
But elsewhere in the country,

00:01:52.348 --> 00:01:53.949
the scenes have been absolutely

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:55.751
catastrophic, Jim, with large

00:01:56.352 --> 00:01:56.885
numbers of villages,

00:01:57.353 --> 00:01:58.754
particularly in the foothills

00:01:59.355 --> 00:02:01.357
of the atlas mountains, being

00:02:01.357 --> 00:02:01.957
totally destroyed.

00:02:02.358 --> 00:02:04.760
We've seen aerial pictures of

00:02:05.027 --> 00:02:06.829
entire villages reduced to this

00:02:07.363 --> 00:02:08.764
kind of rubble, with people of

00:02:09.365 --> 00:02:09.865
course trapped beneath.

00:02:10.366 --> 00:02:11.800
Already in some of the outlying

00:02:12.368 --> 00:02:12.868
villages, there have been

00:02:13.369 --> 00:02:14.803
burial ceremonies, in the

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:15.738
Muslim tradition, getting

00:02:16.004 --> 00:02:16.372
people --

00:02:16.739 --> 00:02:17.940
within 24 hours.

00:02:18.807 --> 00:02:19.742
Almost before it's been

00:02:20.008 --> 00:02:20.876
possible to get relief to some

00:02:21.377 --> 00:02:23.379
of these villages, because the

00:02:23.379 --> 00:02:25.748
communication systems, the

00:02:26.014 --> 00:02:27.850
roads, such as they were, have

00:02:28.384 --> 00:02:29.785
been cut or closed by

00:02:30.386 --> 00:02:30.853
landslides.

00:02:31.387 --> 00:02:32.388
Entire villages have been hit

00:02:32.721 --> 00:02:33.789
by mast landslides, or

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:35.391
themselves have slowed down the

00:02:35.791 --> 00:02:36.392
sides of mountains.

00:02:36.725 --> 00:02:38.060
Many of these environments,

00:02:38.394 --> 00:02:38.927
only accessible by air.

00:02:39.795 --> 00:02:40.996
The king here has announced

00:02:41.397 --> 00:02:42.398
three days of national mourning,

00:02:42.731 --> 00:02:43.932
the army and other services

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:44.933
have been involved in getting

00:02:45.401 --> 00:02:46.869
their aircraft out, to try and

00:02:47.403 --> 00:02:50.005
assess the scale of devastation

00:02:50.406 --> 00:02:50.873
in this country.

00:02:51.407 --> 00:02:52.941
And of course, the aftershocks

00:02:53.409 --> 00:02:54.877
are continuing, or have

00:02:55.411 --> 00:02:55.878
continued within theast 24

00:02:56.412 --> 00:02:58.814
hours, to shake the area,

00:02:59.081 --> 00:02:59.948
particularly in the atlas

00:03:00.416 --> 00:03:00.749
mountains.

00:03:00.749 --> 00:03:02.885
Mercifully, only a very slight

00:03:03.419 --> 00:03:04.820
aftershocks can be felt here in

00:03:05.087 --> 00:03:05.421
marrakech.

00:03:05.754 --> 00:03:06.955
But if one were to strike, then

00:03:07.423 --> 00:03:08.757
it's pretty clear that this

00:03:09.024 --> 00:03:10.826
entire building could fold in

00:03:11.427 --> 00:03:12.428
on itself, into the street.

00:03:12.428 --> 00:03:13.829
And it's for that reason, Jim,

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:15.697
that a huge number of at least

00:03:15.964 --> 00:03:17.833
30% we are told, by a lot of

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:20.836
hotelierre, people who --

00:03:21.437 --> 00:03:23.038
the beautiful many palaces that

00:03:23.439 --> 00:03:24.840
you have throughout the Medina

00:03:25.441 --> 00:03:25.841
here, they've all been

00:03:26.108 --> 00:03:26.842
evacuated.

00:03:27.109 --> 00:03:28.777
All the restaurants closed,

00:03:29.044 --> 00:03:30.846
many, large numbers of ordinary

00:03:31.447 --> 00:03:31.980
Moroccans are now sleeping out

00:03:32.448 --> 00:03:34.783
in the open in parks, or on

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:35.851
roads, Jim.

00:03:36.452 --> 00:03:36.985
And that is in order to be away

00:03:37.453 --> 00:03:38.787
from any of the buildings,

00:03:39.054 --> 00:03:41.723
which will be taking many, many

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.058
months, if not years, to bring

00:03:43.459 --> 00:03:44.860
back to the point of repair, of

00:03:45.127 --> 00:03:45.861
which they no longer pose a

00:03:46.462 --> 00:03:47.863
danger to the people that own,

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:48.997
or to live in them, Jim.

00:03:49.865 --> 00:03:52.734
&gt;&gt; And Sam I mean, you

00:03:53.001 --> 00:03:54.002
addressed, in part, the

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:55.137
question that I was just about

00:03:55.471 --> 00:03:55.537
to ask.

00:03:55.804 --> 00:03:56.805
We were looking at some of this

00:03:57.072 --> 00:03:58.740
video earlier on this evening,

00:03:59.007 --> 00:03:59.808
where looks like you just have

00:04:00.075 --> 00:04:01.743
scores oople living in the

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:02.478
streets.

00:04:03.745 --> 00:04:05.814
And, I'm just wondering, what

00:04:06.081 --> 00:04:06.882
is it that is going to be done

00:04:07.149 --> 00:04:07.950
for those folks?

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:09.918
I imagine that is where the

00:04:10.486 --> 00:04:11.019
international relief efforts

00:04:11.487 --> 00:04:12.488
are going to be sorely needed,

00:04:12.488 --> 00:04:12.955
in the coming days.

00:04:13.655 --> 00:04:15.891
Because it sounds as though,

00:04:16.158 --> 00:04:17.092
and we are looking at some of

00:04:17.493 --> 00:04:18.861
those images right now, these

00:04:19.127 --> 00:04:20.796
folks just sleeping on the

00:04:21.063 --> 00:04:21.497
streets.

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:22.931
It sounds as though these folks

00:04:23.499 --> 00:04:24.132
are going to be without housing

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:25.934
for a very long period of time.

00:04:26.502 --> 00:04:30.806
&gt;&gt; I it's not yet clear, I

00:04:31.073 --> 00:04:32.074
think, to the authorities, Jim,

00:04:32.508 --> 00:04:34.076
the scale, particularly in a

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:35.878
city like marrakech, of the

00:04:36.144 --> 00:04:36.945
people who are going to be

00:04:37.513 --> 00:04:37.813
permanently, or semi

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:38.947
permanently homeless.

00:04:39.515 --> 00:04:41.016
Many people, as a precaution,

00:04:41.517 --> 00:04:41.950
are simply staying out of

00:04:42.518 --> 00:04:43.752
buildings, sleeping in the open,

00:04:44.019 --> 00:04:44.953
because that way, from their

00:04:45.521 --> 00:04:46.154
view, is the safest thing to

00:04:46.822 --> 00:04:46.889
do.

00:04:47.155 --> 00:04:47.956
The weather is not so bad, so

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:49.892
that's conceivable for a night

00:04:50.158 --> 00:04:50.826
or two.

00:04:51.093 --> 00:04:51.760
But at the same time of course,

00:04:52.027 --> 00:04:52.828
the authorities need to be able

00:04:53.095 --> 00:04:55.030
to supply water, get the water

00:04:55.531 --> 00:04:55.898
supply going.

00:04:56.164 --> 00:04:58.767
And above all, make sure that

00:04:59.034 --> 00:04:59.902
these homes can be lived in.

00:05:00.769 --> 00:05:02.170
Many many millions of dollars

00:05:02.538 --> 00:05:03.772
have been spent over the last

00:05:04.039 --> 00:05:04.907
decades, hundreds of millions

00:05:05.173 --> 00:05:07.042
on restoring this ancient city.

00:05:07.776 --> 00:05:09.778
And, that now has got to start

00:05:10.045 --> 00:05:10.846
all over again.

00:05:11.113 --> 00:05:11.547
&gt;&gt; Wow.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:13.982
All right, Sam kiley, they have

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:15.017
a lot of work ahead of them.

00:05:15.784 --> 00:05:16.785
They are in Morocco, we

00:05:17.052 --> 00:05:17.920
appreciate all the reporting

00:05:18.186 --> 00:05:19.054
you've done this evening, thank

00:05:19.555 --> 00:05:19.788
you very much.

00:05:19.788 --> 00:05:21.056
And in the last hour, I spoke

00:05:21.557 --> 00:05:22.858
with Carmen merino, she's a

00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:24.793
humanitarian worker who was

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:25.861
vacationing in Morocco, when

00:05:26.128 --> 00:05:26.862
the earthquake hit.

00:05:27.129 --> 00:05:27.863
And here's what she told me.

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:33.936
&gt;&gt; I heard this from, people

00:05:34.202 --> 00:05:34.570
screaming.

00:05:35.737 --> 00:05:39.841
And, their lights were all off

00:05:40.108 --> 00:05:41.877
in side the infrastructure of

00:05:42.144 --> 00:05:42.945
the airport, and the building.

00:05:43.745 --> 00:05:46.815
And then, very quickly, I

00:05:47.082 --> 00:05:48.817
thought again with these images,

00:05:49.885 --> 00:05:50.819
I experienced earlier this

00:05:51.086 --> 00:05:51.219
year.

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:53.755
And, I realized it was an

00:05:54.022 --> 00:05:54.222
earthquake.

00:05:54.756 --> 00:05:56.825
But honestly, I didn't think it

00:05:57.092 --> 00:06:01.763
was this hard, this high

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:02.831
magnitude.

00:06:03.765 --> 00:06:05.767
&gt;&gt; And, learn how you can help

00:06:06.034 --> 00:06:06.902
victims of the Morocco

